Output docs/rust-port/assets/cp5-rust-default.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "node dist/main.js --no-update-check /tmp/cp5-demo/todo.txt"
Enter
Sleep 8s
Type "/"
Sleep 500ms
Type "work"
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Space
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
Sleep 2s
Type "cat /tmp/cp5-demo/todo.txt"
Enter
Sleep 3s
